Subject: toast-v2: the region observes its own portal host

What: ToastV2Region takes a ref to its Portal host and observes only that host
for toasts and `data-visible` changes, then syncs role, inert and tabIndex from it.
The document-wide body observer and the connect-once handshake are gone.
Why: the body observer connected to the regions present at first mutation and never
reconnected, so a toast added after the region emptied and re-rendered was neither
announced nor made inert when stacked out.

